    "operations": [
      "Environment regrade outside the protected silhouette: desaturate beige toward pearl, cool mids, champagne highlights, lift ({'sat': 0.46, 'cool': 0.5, 'champ': 1.0, 'lift': 0.12, 'gamma': 0.96}); ramps from 0 at the mask edge to full over 200px",
      "Wide: crop 61px off the top of the master, extend left 330px and right 83px with blurred bands of the regraded silk (bands graded {'sat': 0.3, 'cool': 1.2, 'champ': 0.8, 'lift': 0.15, 'gamma': 0.96})",
      "Tall: crop master x590..1310, y20..941, extend bottom 470px the same way",
      "Round 2: flare streaks behind the lid/jar softened and desaturated (environment-only masked blur, hxh_pearl_grade.FLARES); tall floor warmed to #F2EEE8 and faded to #FBFAF7 on the last row",
      "Copy fields calmed: blend toward a Gaussian-blurred copy of the environment, never inside the protected mask",
      "Re-paste every protected-mask pixel from the supplied master at native scale",
      "Proportional Lanczos resize (the wide 2560 file is a 1.23x upscale of the 2085px composite), then AVIF/WebP/JPEG compression"
